<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
    .content { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-top: none; }
    .info-box { background-color: #e8f5e9; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
    .info-row { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    .label { font-weight: bold; color: #555; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Request Received</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
      <p>Thank you for submitting your professional service request. Our team will review your request and get back to you shortly.</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>Your Request Summary</strong>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Request #:</span> {{requestNumber}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Service Type:</span> {{serviceType}}</div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="label">Consultation Date:</span> {{consultationDate}}</div>
      </div>

      <p>We'll contact you within 24-48 hours to confirm your consultation.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The PropertyArk Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{currentYear}} PropertyArk. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>